{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_047sub0094_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_047sub0094_1000_p", "source_sha256": "8247604772ebd1ead16641d0f83b13db4c2a5a226cb62e17f8a73928dff56f52", "ja": "（今日は、バレンタインキャンペーンのPV撮影日。\n昴の撮影は順調、監督の評価もいい感じだ）", "zh": "（今天是情人节宣传活动的PV拍摄日。\n昴拍摄得很顺利，导演的评价感觉也不错。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_047sub0094_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_047sub0094_1001_p", "source_sha256": "8231ea68e840f3921a4123b3289f715e24010ddbf40b686146d0d1deba8278dd", "ja": "（けど、だいぶ飛ばしてる気がする……。\n休憩中は、しっかり休ませないとだな）", "zh": "（不过，总觉得她冲太快了……\n得让她在休息时间好好休息。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_047sub0094_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_047sub0094_1002_047sub", "source_sha256": "1269810f9c881c21b1b113f36f333d06a0a71538a48457da45cd2159ff6fa106", "ja": "{$P$}、お疲れー！\nふー、休憩休憩♪　オレ、腹減っちゃった！", "zh": "{$P$}，辛苦啦──！\n呼──休息休息♪我肚子饿了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_047sub0094_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_047sub0094_1003_p", "source_sha256": "eac48364520a7b49e9d8d94533e23a682717d90153cd0c33ba141b552bd388be", "ja": "昴、お疲れさま。\n今のカット、よかったな。監督も褒めてたぞ。", "zh": "昴，拍摄辛苦了。\n刚才那一幕拍得很棒，连导演都称赞你啰。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_047sub0094_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_047sub0094_1004_047sub", "source_sha256": "a8a913afb6181ce57f0963d2da3662ac29b231a4353f614aaa9e3bb5b0e2fbe0", "ja": "マジで！？\nオレも、「きまった！」って思ってたんだよな～♪", "zh": "真的吗！？\n我刚才也觉得拍得很棒～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_047sub0094_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_047sub0094_1005_047sub", "source_sha256": "0ec1e39256461eeea08bd59b3a7f1689043e297761c88e4a8901fb59e6f3325e", "ja": "今日のオレ、なんか絶好調って感じなんだ。\nPV、すっげーいい感じになるかもな！", "zh": "今天的我感觉状态超好的。\n也许可以拍出超棒的PV！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_047sub0094_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_047sub0094_1006_p", "source_sha256": "35ff747d1815dd598d266b658f375b089eedbe38d59647e216f58523d7292441", "ja": "元気なのはいいけど、調子に乗りすぎないようにな。\nあんまり飛ばしすぎると、最後までもたないぞ。", "zh": "有活力是很好，但不要得意忘形。\n你要是冲过头，会没办法撑到最后喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_047sub0094_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_047sub0094_1007_p", "source_sha256": "6b5ec0711174b0c8a25335480d700b03373f26b39977e5f397c9aa534b6ec7e3", "ja": "というか……\n昴、ちょっとバテてきてないか？", "zh": "应该说……\n昴，你是不是开始有点累了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_047sub0094_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_047sub0094_1008_047sub", "source_sha256": "592580a2b295b3488d8034cb289eb24ba57caac0147a721a80089b840de1f8af", "ja": "げっ！　{$P$}、\nどうして気づいたんだよ！？", "zh": "呃！{$P$}，\n你怎么会发现啊！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_047sub0094_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_047sub0094_1009_p", "source_sha256": "ec9f681c432f1957b0705b6532081b23c6f8f45d595bad96f5cb440fe87a731e", "ja": "そりゃあ、毎日のように昴を見てるからな。\nプロデューサーの目はごまかせないぞ！", "zh": "毕竟我几乎每天都在看着昴。\n你可瞒不过制作人的眼睛！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_047sub0094_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_047sub0094_1010_047sub", "source_sha256": "c696c29b1fbf68958afb3ef1eb99a47ee607f717baf91c0a335d362b006b9769", "ja": "うわっ、さすがオレのプロデューサーだな……。\nへへ、ちょっと気合い入れすぎちゃったみたいでさ。", "zh": "呜哇，不愧是我的制作人……\n嘿嘿，我好像有点拚过头了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_047sub0094_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_047sub0094_1011_p", "source_sha256": "bc8349161df7b9a44011ac6ae391c83d98e2d8f47b00e5a7f571e8a6d0dc8502", "ja": "そうか。気合いを入れるのはいいけど、\n無理をするのはダメだからな？", "zh": "这样啊。\n有干劲是好事，但不可以逞强喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_047sub0094_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_047sub0094_1012_047sub", "source_sha256": "f1d32b76076115c1413c11ead718fcabcba57467d03470f515e3cd25ca6dd808", "ja": "わかってるって！\nだからさ、ほら、コレ持ってきたんだ！", "zh": "我知道啦！\n所以，你看，我带这个来了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_047sub0094_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_047sub0094_1013_p", "source_sha256": "889235e661b62c3caa52694277cd37e95dbf68e225f5955c75db4582385f1fa8", "ja": "これは……チョコレート？", "zh": "这是……巧克力？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_047sub0094_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_047sub0094_1014_047sub", "source_sha256": "491bb7ff7257980b2563a4e0245f8a590af49f17632e3bd82ed5f52d0b7fbcdd", "ja": "そっ。バレンタインの仕事だからって、\nお菓子メーカーの人が、たくさんくれただろ？", "zh": "没错，因为是情人节的工作，\n糖果厂商的人不是给了我很多巧克力吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_047sub0094_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_047sub0094_1015_047sub", "source_sha256": "0839cccd13530679cb2264ce677838d3041de63a5175c4ea829b6815a5d5c201", "ja": "劇場でみんなにわけたし、家にも持って帰ったけど、\nまだまだいっぱいあるからさ～。", "zh": "我有在剧场分给大家，也带了一些回家，\n但还剩好多喔～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_047sub0094_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_047sub0094_1016_p", "source_sha256": "e05b0d51950f2cc545e4c0a68a91fb01ffc290b079418979b47ecc2ae56e7b13", "ja": "それで、おやつに持ってきたのか。\nでも、いい判断だな。疲れた時には糖分だ！", "zh": "所以你就带来当点心了啊。\n不过，这个决定是对的，疲倦时就是要补充糖分！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_047sub0094_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_047sub0094_1017_047sub", "source_sha256": "077d6425af902dc1a3b9b65692cb078b82a39a66c88bb9fec1ba28a693c00c02", "ja": "だろ？　オレ、なんかで聞いたことあったんだ！\n「疲れたときは甘いモノがいい」ってさ♪", "zh": "对吧？我好像听说过！\n「疲劳时吃甜食是最好的」♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_047sub0094_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_047sub0094_1018_047sub", "source_sha256": "ae26bc34616f1344b937bd098786bc135813d4c37ae83145300078c4c829742b", "ja": "{$P$}も食べなよ！\nこのチョコ、すっげー甘くてウマいんだぜ♪", "zh": "{$P$}也吃吧！\n这些巧克力超甜超──好吃喔♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_047sub0094_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_047sub0094_1019_p", "source_sha256": "4db0231045aba78cc143c63263980d9d9c0cbd992337cc47fb4bf50a3bd2b9f4", "ja": "はは、そうだな。じゃあいただくよ。\n……うん、甘くて美味いな！", "zh": "哈哈，也对，那我就不客气了。\n……嗯，好甜好好吃！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_047sub0094_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_047sub0094_1020_047sub", "source_sha256": "0d1574231239a535b0eaa8dac69c750bf31eaf34bedf16fd14ec87d353660d77", "ja": "チョコ食べたら、元気が出てきた！\nオレ、もうひとがんばりしてくるな！", "zh": "吃了巧克力后，我又有精神了！\n我要过去继续努力了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_047sub0094_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_047sub0094_1021_047sub", "source_sha256": "34355af35ad9ca4cbcb94c8ce72eae66f616701a13751a5e45b4670bc118fd2d", "ja": "よーし！　見ててくれよな、\n{$P$}！　……おっとっと。", "zh": "我要上啰──！{$P$}，好好看着吧！\n……哇啊啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_047sub0094_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_047sub0094_1022_p", "source_sha256": "66e17b910e367fe074ec93e1601882e20e42abe4332dea6c82523c91c27fc0cd", "ja": "ああ、だから無理はダメだって……\n休憩時間が終わるまで、おとなしく休んでおこうな。", "zh": "真是的，就说了不可以逞强……\n在休息时间结束前，乖乖地休息吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_047sub0094_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_047sub0094_1023_047sub", "source_sha256": "36c1e0e3d7146f47e0deb1bb9e06e84151eda92a7b3d7106f047e7c8a9048b68", "ja": "うん、わかった……。\nえっと、{$P$}。サンキュな！", "zh": "嗯，我知道了……\n那个，{$P$}，谢啦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_047sub0094_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_047sub0094_1024_047sub", "source_sha256": "e2ccd8a59626f57a85e08706d6fc57b936fcf1b2cc3ed09bd8c70971cd3cf33b", "ja": "ちゃんと休んで、後半もバシッとストライク\n決めてくるぜ♪　パーフェクトゲームにしてやるよ！", "zh": "我会好好休息，在后半段继续投出好球♪\n我一定会达成完全比赛！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
